## 🎉 Releasing v1.0

### Download
- Download `TouchscreenToggle-v1.0.zip` below
- Extract and run `Install.exe`

### What's New
✅ Core touchscreen toggle functionality
✅ Professional installer with auto-device detection
✅ Multi-language support (EN, ES, FR, DE, RU)
✅ Visual settings panel
✅ Action history tracking
✅ Auto-enable safety features

### System Requirements
- Windows 10/11
-65x architecture

### Installation
1. Download ZIP
2. Extract all files
3. Run `Install.exe` as Administrator
4. Follow setup wizard

For detailed instructions, see the [README](https://github.com/savagevoid/TouchscreenToggle#readme).
